[{"title":"宿庄严寺与僧","author":"王问","text":"落日荒江外，春风野寺中。\n蓬心无定着，萍迹任西东。\n近墅莺犹涩，绕堤花欲红。\n惟应把明烛，一宿与谈空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九里泾怀陈山人","author":"王问","text":"扰扰风尘后，重来泾上宫。\n门临寒水次，秋尽叶声中。\n岁序忽复暮，幽怀谁与同。\n思君西岭下，蓬户掩深松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻警","author":"王问","text":"皇家设险在居庸，薄伐谁当上将功。\n胡骑尽从青海至，边烽遥傍黑山红。\n蓟门羽士颁新竹，辽水征书下朔风。\n闻道移营向山后，可令坚垒白羊东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾影自叹","author":"王问","text":"几番梦里脱根尘，觉后翻嫌再有身。\n今夜月明还在地，任渠明灭影中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春山独步","author":"王问","text":"春深原树绿初齐，山拥芙蓉水漫溪。\n独自携筇上山去，小亭犹在万峰西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴之山","author":"王问","text":"城柝声悲月未央，江云初散水风凉。\n看君已是无家客，犹自逢人说故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日江上别梅屋","author":"王问","text":"改岁桃开杨子津，蔡家洲上独伤春。\n客怀欲向愁中尽，又折残花别故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示儿阳得","author":"施渐","text":"喟然置琴书，白日闲如此。\n共以蓬蒿身，相去南北里。\n高楼多远心，流云过如水。\n有意不能言，悲来但思尔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起行园治蔬","author":"施渐","text":"处疴情方愆，览籍亦棼结。\n止迹丘樊间，喜与荷锄列。\n晨星沐未遑，周葺幸余力。\n夙英始敛华，密露若莹雪。\n螽趯感离歌，祼鸣及豳月。\n萋萋瓜畔空，厌厌豆畦歇。\n观化有消虚，征情既伸屈。\n庶几东陵隐，岂伊公仪哲。\n永此藿食资，耕凿藏吾劣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏田居偶言","author":"施渐","text":"乞身去贱吏，荣慕非所关。\n此形谅偶寄，乘委须共还。\n田间理初务，务毕仍自闲。\n颓罂惜无酒，开尊聊怡颜。\n高禽迎新枝，轻云投前山。\n俯仰一如此，勿云时命悭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋中雨歇自述","author":"施渐","text":"高窗晦积雨，连晨娱篇帙。\n耽慵情方宜，嗜寂意尤密。\n风柔园条变，溜湿阶蔬茁。\n宿阴渐已收，幽禽时唧唧。\n隐几欲忘言，斜光透云日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步池上","author":"施渐","text":"弄翰乘暇日，池上步逍遥。\n寒鱼翻在藻，落叶乱鸣条。\n流序忽如此，寸心久自要。\n蓬飞定有止，意远不嫌嚣。\n常念沮溺辈，躬耕趣独超。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠金山智公","author":"施渐","text":"四顾水皆绕，所居幽出尘。\n斋钟不到岸，渔火自来邻。\n心共寒潭彻，经翻贝叶新。\n住山知有道，一叩了无因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日游天竺寺","author":"施渐","text":"缘湖始欣往，遐览历幽寻。\n山到不容路，云藏犹有林。\n阶前寒涧落，榻下白云深。\n积雪千峰里，寥然空世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵谷寺善上人诵经处","author":"施渐","text":"释子岂不见，持心世绝无。\n悟因诸部入，定似一身枯。\n林霭凝香气，山光积坐趺。\n寥然断尘伴，惟与法王俱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病移南窗下作","author":"施渐","text":"南窗堪处默，病里率天真。\n静阅庄生传，闲观物外身。\n疏槐千点雨，返照满衣尘。\n何事常留此，东林谢主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王仲山见访溪上田居","author":"施渐","text":"同归五湖住，一水见君家。\n渔父迷初路，居人认落花。\n御贫多种菽，为圃却宜瓜。\n共是裘羊侣，往来忘岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自邸趋归荆溪口作","author":"施渐","text":"久客不得志，束装归旧山。\n休争逆旅席，早觉主人颜。\n意比溪云懒，形同秋水闲。\n蜀中相共笑，扬子又空还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨斋中志静","author":"施渐","text":"深似山中住，偏多风雨时。\n莺稀出谷响，叶暗到门枝。\n老氏但柔气，愚公宁有知。\n跫然习已久，不自觉春迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7254,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白白氏别业归斋中","author":"施渐","text":"自喜茅斋僻，经时草木深。\n见人稀倒屣，抱膝或长吟。\n疏雨喧庭雀，闲窗澄夕阴。\n会心方在寡，碌碌岂知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7255,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暑中闲述","author":"施渐","text":"宿雨未为深，晴光已满林。\n微风松际歇，凉霭竹间沉。\n地僻容身散，交疏少物侵。\n常嫌子桑户，今日废衣衿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7256,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日溪行寻唐荆川太史","author":"施渐","text":"野水将孤楫，晴天雾半收。\n寒禽自向日，残叶尚如秋。\n好道宁辞晚，谋生岂解愁。\n思君时一见，犹免失东丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7257,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再和补庵新正三日同往山中值顾宪副","author":"施渐","text":"孟月逢春早，时芳欲满林。\n偶同长者席，况似谷中音。\n斜日下清磬，高云过客襟。\n回舟傍微月，犹听隔溪吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7258,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕斋中独坐","author":"施渐","text":"独怜今夜静，红烛对人清。\n户密凝香气，窗虚纳市声。\n华镫自斗彩，满月却嫌明。\n一步疏檐下，春星纵复横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7259,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春斋居漫兴二首 其一","author":"施渐","text":"此地寓来僻，清渠正绕庐。\n数畦聊学圃，一径不容车。\n图列壁间岫，书翻几上鱼。\n谋生已无术，元不慕相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7260,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春斋居漫兴二首 其二","author":"施渐","text":"静里心常觉，尘中人岂知。\n柴门独掩后，春草复生时。\n泽国为渔晚，江湖好道迟。\n总能谈寂寞，只费子云辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7261,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得江帆送蒋氏归仪真","author":"施渐","text":"挂席发秋早，微风已满樯。\n中流片影去，远水一舟将。\n海雨忽来重，江云相带凉。\n知投孝廉宅，三径接苍茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7262,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院暮春有感作","author":"施渐","text":"物境俱玄寂，客心常少欢。\n非因无酒赏，只是到花残。\n夜雨深林叶，春塘平钓竿。\n羁栖幸堪托，终日懒衣冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7263,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬州道中送李司训还金陵因赴任河内","author":"施渐","text":"初见即如故，爱君无世情。\n官惟旧经术，家只一蓬衡。\n乡树千重雨，江门几日程。\n还过大梁市，试为访侯嬴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7264,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日与华从龙俞汝成泛湖上","author":"施渐","text":"相携出井邑，轻舟泛秋水。\n樵响满晴山，游霭缘原起。\n濯足湖上流，浩思方如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7265,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和万吴二明府夜集俞汝成读书园","author":"施渐","text":"去市未为远，到门终是幽。\n小池阶下满，嘉木雨余柔。\n鸟影高台近，春香各径浮。\n不妨车马客，暂此共林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7266,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日斋中遣兴","author":"施渐","text":"信是陶潜宅，为园已就荒。\n术疏堪借隐，名贱岂相妨。\n日暮闲心旷，春阴药径芳。\n流年愧蘧氏，一使是非忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7267,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑初春再至南都","author":"施渐","text":"客衣又见染缁尘，才到京门是早春。\n旧寺逢僧已隔岁，同邻问友半归人。\n寒轻远岫烟中绿，水满平湖雪后新。\n自叹不如沮溺辈，却忘畎亩去寻津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7268,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送倪郴州","author":"施渐","text":"远郡皆言不易为，如君才术总相宜。\n弹琴自可安氓俗，长策何须事外夷。\n一水湖湘连网罟，满田禾稻映山埤。\n到来几许登临兴，五岭人归说与知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7269,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访子裕户郤漆塘新居","author":"施渐","text":"湖上青山隔市尘，久闻樵采满荒榛。\n闲云无主还归壑，槲叶成阴少住人。\n高士偶来轻汉绶，桃源从此是通津。\n知君不厌裘羊迹，斜日松间一挂巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7270,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闭斋自述寄王驾部","author":"施渐","text":"始知蓬藋蔽门深，岂是幽居避物心。\n旧业尽荒秋雨里，一身闲卧碧溪阴。\n园空三径人稀到，名在诸生老半侵。\n几度忆君相共语，高山无伴只囊琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7271,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日园居","author":"施渐","text":"一逢秋日已凄其，却卧园庐有所思。\n高士游方婚嫁毕，仙翁卖药世人疑。\n寒蝉断续犹知晚，旅雁浮沉亦后期。\n流水不将心事远，闲湍空自向东驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7272,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰溪唐君锡将访人江上夜会华明伯席作","author":"施渐","text":"畴昔相闻已有情，朅来一见各心惊。\n笑言千里不自意，霜露满衣犹欲行。\n江口雁飞逢岁暮，渡头人去趁潮平。\n看君到处多迎送，定向王生叩《论衡》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7273,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏偶作","author":"施渐","text":"道院春归寂不知，过林新叶接邻枝。\n青山药长已忘约，别墅花残只悔迟。\n胜事每同幽士往，高车绝少故人期。\n翻嫌贫贱闲如此，芳径时来听鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7274,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送万君应召之京","author":"施渐","text":"如君为政岂谋身，当宁知名有几人。\n解棹犹余五湖兴，匣琴方见一官贫。\n楚山偏是淮南绿，旧友何如帝里亲。\n却望清班隔尘世，秋风茅屋更谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7275,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜溧阳野泊写怀","author":"施渐","text":"野水悠悠岁易阑，客舟行处乱峰攒。\n山中一雨诸溪满，湖上孤村独夜寒。\n世事已将樗共朽，浮名犹是雁求磐。\n莫因旅食空弹铗，今日侯门少问餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7276,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日过长荡湖野望","author":"施渐","text":"不因修禊过春山，谁得澄湖一望间。\n顿觉尘心空水上，偶逢渔父语沙间。\n几多沃野桑麻蔽，半是荒畬雁鹜还。\n日夕微茫僧问渡，双峰寂历掩禅关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7277,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京邸感兴","author":"施渐","text":"到来园柳已菲菲，客舍经春未改衣。\n学道岂能辞众笑，随人终愧失初机。\n窗间晓漏临丹阙，户外晴岚对翠微。\n僻兴止宜耽寂寞，独翻书史度斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7278,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病卧县斋呈诸僚长","author":"施渐","text":"岂是官卑易去留，未能高蹈愧林丘。\n公庭积夏常虚讼，弱质逢秋已制裘。\n雨带潮声偏傍枕，山连雁影恰当楼。\n世途转觉萧疏甚，始信嵇康薄宦游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7279,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归田自述二首 其一","author":"施渐","text":"佐邑无功自劾归，尚疑趋府倒裳衣。\n下流应笑难为吏，僻路于今亦有机。\n与客解嘲前日谬，逢僧授偈一身非。\n卧来转觉人群远，惟有闲窗鸟雀飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7280,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归田自述二首 其二","author":"施渐","text":"未论薄俗贱为儒，自顾无如返旧庐。\n瓜美宁思故侯禄，身闲遍读外家书。\n林逢秋日收香草，门傍寒江市白鱼。\n岁晚谁同濠上想，惟余惠子共踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7281,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄唐荆川","author":"施渐","text":"雪里从君今早秋，不羁踪迹转沉浮。\n身同逆旅家常隔，道遍名山访未休。\n野寺老僧传近作，江潭黄叶识孤舟。\n相逢每怪经年别，此别经年半白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7282,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日居田园有感","author":"施渐","text":"霏霏轻霭薄朝晖，又见凉飔一叶飞。\n气早畴官已应闰，天移星火欲流辉。\n黍苗遍野劳歌少，杞菊成畦生事微。\n谁谓门闲可罗雀，秋风转觉雀来稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7283,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓居寺閤晚坐遣兴","author":"施渐","text":"高阁东林出翠微，万家烟树晚依依。\n凉风入院僧初定，片月临窗鸟独归。\n学道但令知我少，逃空始觉足音稀。\n社中何用求玄度，久住深山自息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7284,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆山中旧游","author":"施渐","text":"还将踪迹共飘蓬，不但离家似客中。\n春水看来随意远，林芳约后几时空。\n说《诗》岂解令人笑，缮性多惭与俗同。\n闻道山间更幽寂，每寻鸣鹤造支公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7285,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南山隈","author":"施渐","text":"一因摇落后，怅望秋天空。\n向晚寻归径，村村夕照中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7286,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"网集潭","author":"施渐","text":"朝向湖上去，暮从湖上归。\n渔家自成市，晒网及斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7287,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴二首 其一","author":"施渐","text":"门外清渠映葛衣，偶来观物上渔矶。\n秋风蘋末鸥惊起，始悟山人未息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7288,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴二首 其二","author":"施渐","text":"久不逢人道姓名，从来愚谷寡将迎。\n教儿莫漫除秋叶，庭叶自深人自行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7289,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腊月望对月次答汝成","author":"施渐","text":"叶尽林皋影正圆，岁阑相对总凄然。\n年年独卧衡门下，只是清辉照旧颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7290,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪稍积林树扶疏可爱因忆城中诸友","author":"施渐","text":"日晏论文雪满林，春寒还似岁残深。\n遥知郭里无人见，独对高原生远心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7291,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠欧道士卖茶","author":"施渐","text":"静守《黄庭》不炼丹，因贫却得一身闲。\n自看火候蒸茶熟，野鹿衔筐送下山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7292,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日望山中寄旧僧二首 其一","author":"施渐","text":"秋原落日见青山，遥识僧居杳霭间。\n指点却疑身已到，满窗萝叶上人闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7293,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日望山中寄旧僧二首 其二","author":"施渐","text":"身慵常愧扣朝钟，每听楞伽是梦中。\n今日别来应共笑，犹悬旧榻待秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7294,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻吹箫","author":"施渐","text":"夜半闻声莫问谁，急将幽怨向人吹。\n秋风不与闲心会，只有窗前明月知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7295,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题倪元镇小画","author":"施渐","text":"片石丛篁岂在多，丹青只论意如何。\n若能咫尺看千里，即是潇湘壁上过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7296,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中夜有感","author":"施渐","text":"牵牛西转雉楼高，残月亭亭午夜潮。\n客久不知颜鬓改，一声城角起岧峣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7297,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上","author":"施渐","text":"秦山青截海门斜，万筏凌秋叠浅沙。\n聚落萧疏耕读尽，潮来潮往是生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7298,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移家湖上作","author":"王懋明","text":"夙昔厌喧扰，湖堧聊聚庐。\n五柳阴到门，客子携家初。\n欢言治隐计，织屦兼艺蔬。\n妻孥哂荒陋，而我良自舒。\n鱼鸟适幽性，水竹澄贫居。\n开帘峰翠繁，停舟潭月虚。\n心与胜概遇，迹将城府疏。\n养生黄精饭，销忧老氏书。\n了悟损益理，何须儋石储。\n食力愧伯鸾，攻文匪相如。\n所长惟达命，天地宁穷予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7299,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"始家湖上寄城中诸友","author":"王懋明","text":"负郭无绪业，因家濠湖濆。\n扁舟归草堂，东溪生夏云。\n居然满幽致，得与木石群。\n兹地风俗厚，所事不尚文。\n童年已樵采，壮者俱耕耘。\n予怀太古风，出门日。\n税地给家食，借书广前闻。\n野趣足心目，水流涤炎氛。\n群山映五柳，空翠常氤氲。\n隐居以求志，殷勤谢诸君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7300,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中与隆池彭丈酌酒","author":"王懋明","text":"访旧回兰桡，风光适和煦。\n卷帷望春山，几处含残雨。\n偶尔携一樽，欢焉阅众甫。\n清言兼古今，满引无宾主。\n桃花笑欲言，鸥鸟翔可取。\n烟波娱性灵，逝将友渔父。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7301,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿玉阳山房","author":"王懋明","text":"涧道行转深，余霞灭残景。\n然灯宿山房，枕席云泉冷。\n始知玉潭隈，乃有真仙境。\n翠微一磬幽，霁月寥天静。\n叶落霜渐寒，秋高夜弥永。\n不寐若有怀，啼鼯下松岭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7302,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中待施少府","author":"王懋明","text":"美人太古心，一见即倾倒。\n自别梁溪花，相思长秋草。\n缄书昨寓言，山中共论讨。\n把袂虽有期，挂席苦不早。\n凉月映桂林，夜思伤怀抱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":7303,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]